<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Housing data consistent with budget-Costello.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Housing data consistent with budget-Costello.</headline>
<dateline>CANBERRA 1997-06-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australian Treasurer Peter Costello said on Tuesday recent housing approvals data was consistent with budget forecasts for a pick-up in housing investment in 1997.</p>
<p>&quot;This is consistent with the budget outlook of a recovery in dwelling investment over 1997,&quot; Costello told parliament.</p>
</text>
